---
// A command to copy. Write it as <Cmd>{`kubectl get pods -n shop`}</Cmd> when it holds braces or quotes.
---
<div class="codeblock" data-cmd>
  <span class="codeblock-label mono">Command</span>
  <pre><code><slot /></code></pre>
  <button type="button" class="codeblock-copy mono" data-copy>Copy</button>
</div>
